{
  "npcs": [
    {
      "id": "dream_keeper",
      "name": "守梦人",
      "name_key": "npc.dream_keeper.name",
      "skin": "standard",
      "decoration": "uniban",
      "emote": "happy",
      "dialogs": [
        {
          "id": "greeting",
          "text_key": "npc.dream_keeper.greeting",
          "text": [
            "Flower：这座图书馆收藏着古老的传说。随意翻阅吧。",
            "",
            "[按 ESC → 魔法页 查看/学习魔法]"
          ],
          "conditions": {
            "not_flag": "has_pistol"
          },
          "actions": [
            {
              "type": "open_skills",
              "key": "skills"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "story",
          "text_key": "npc.dream_keeper.story",
          "text": [
            "[图书馆] ─── 故事 ───",
            "Flower：你口袋里装着的……是天灵族的遗物。",
            "Flower：很久以前，一位强大的魔法师对所有天灵下了诅咒。",
            "Flower：她们永远无法得到最渴望的东西。",
            "Flower：你知道那把枪的主人是谁，对吧？",
            "Flower：她的名字已被世界抹除……这也是诅咒的一部分。",
            "Flower：如果你想救她，去首都打听消息吧。但想进去可不简单——",
            "Flower：你必须是贵族、加入TeeFun组织，或者有足够的位阶。"
          ],
          "conditions": {
            "flag": "has_pistol",
            "not_flag": "met_flower"
          },
          "actions": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "key": "met_flower"
            },
            {
              "type": "add_reputation",
              "value": 20,
              "message": "[任务完成: 星的消逝 声望+20]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "followup",
          "text_key": "npc.dream_keeper.followup",
          "text": [
            "Flower：有什么新线索吗？",
            "继续提升你的位阶吧——首都可不会欢迎无名小卒。",
            "",
            "[按 ESC 可查看魔法页]"
          ],
          "conditions": {
            "flag": "met_flower"
          },
          "actions": [
            {
              "type": "open_skills",
              "key": "skills"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
